{
  "__comment__": "Hardware-free visual/test setup for the SimpleMoNaLISA cloak. The real scan backend is Advanced with BetaScanDesigner; scan.cloak selects SimpleMoNaLISA. Simulated NI-DAQ axes and binary lasers let the scan design run without hardware. The mock AV camera is included mainly so the configured read-out detector and its TTL pulse are visible in Advanced; this first cloak has no overview mode.",
